# peerbot port catalog
# name | port | role | good_reason (when opening is justified)
#
# Default policy: DENY. Open only what the current test needs.
# See docs/PEERBOT.md

loco     | 8080 | local services on this machine          | testing loco / local Styx or HTTP on this host
grid     | 9090 | shared / distributed fabric             | testing registry discovery or multi-node glue
registry | 6675 | classic Styx registry (cluster internal)| debugging k8s registry (prefer grid alias)
cpupool  | 6676 | classic CPU pool (cluster internal)     | debugging workers (expert)
emulator | 6677 | classic emu Styx (cluster internal)     | debugging emu (prefer loco alias)
metrics  | 9100 | prometheus metrics                      | scraping while validating monitoring
